      <NameIsFileName value="True" />
      <Name>04_dq_validation</Name>
      <Description>DQ gate (metadata-driven, incremental). Rules live in config.DQRule; SQL rules run inside SQL Server through the DQ_RunRules batch macro and only scan files whose content hash is not yet in audit.Audit_FileControl. Violations go to audit.Audit_DQException; passing rows are appended to stg.*Valid for workflow 05; one Audit_FileControl row per file (New / Reprocessed / Duplicate / Rejected).</Description>
